&_nc_ohc=rP_VCeWxiWMQ7kNvwHKP9g5&_nc_oc=AdrdlzrX_btln3pZx4Lm59L7b46nGimwoOFJcfHK9RVoF76_THd1eZ3w6xLHFV-1Z-g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLVfSI_N293aErA_xjHT5Iaf9x9M-sI7dlcEXnhUJlAJg&oe=6ABA6183"}]}, "id": "4356029028044012", "locale": "pt_BR", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "home_10_Quest.png", "id": "1471900691162468", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307435_1471900694495801_4829947570561919049_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QAR9dEIEoEIQ7kNvwH0isBQ&_nc_oc=Adp6z8alMC7FczUhAS0UJyhMoA59Pmc2k2ruv49Kfb7itbHuVJFupVwIIziPj-4LNDI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLP8iyw9QZ5NpwR41VbuljVZOCMHe5UMwmifSAfXTboMA&oe=6ABA904B"}, {"file_name": "settings_10_Quest.png", "id": "1391193859145570", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308010_1391193862478903_5269474807905197381_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=utT4QawxVE8Q7kNvwGXrTUl&_nc_oc=Adq-AgnGkNr7vq41wHCTieIZH1QW_XNKgjcVe2DRO-S-c-PoevPNniPRYVGj-wvkK4o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKLg_St8OP75zi1-v4Jp2rpbxXM47et8pclMaBm97vZdg&oe=6ABA6EC1"}, {"file_name": "home_10_settings_Quest.png", "id": "890412220264365", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310817_890412223597698_6569410573752295327_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gGdrB463LIwQ7kNvwGAnB_A&_nc_oc=AdpE9UnHd4LBk-7NyqtVsjc-8T-kG8qJ4RO2zQYAF4jtT5rwtYrNeDY4htLQRYj3juE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQImRqKR3tOhWF7zH1yyylhJRYEskgWSNkncgn25X6qXnA&oe=6ABA8804"}, {"file_name": "edit_10_Quest.png", "id": "1209432111385989", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310731_1209432114719322_5500871760126419425_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RdmYJ0M3ViMQ7kNvwH-Txpd&_nc_oc=Adr0c2lZooVXSFBko8ZKTnlX_cxtymqgYLRY2ssLm-ZlwxQ3rUN-cl_ZLzoJCT-5PwU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJemIryhGoR-d4dob5CoMKJmL_pJ6J8LBuKaEqoljMCzQ&oe=6ABA7BC1"}, {"file_name": "player_10_Quest.png", "id": "908261954943342", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303746_908261961610008_2600051788214719246_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=T2dZuqA94ecQ7kNvwG9oVnj&_nc_oc=Adr6_P_0gQM06ulCcfjnZCeWO2z8dI0OJAMzEIRmYAWe_3OJpdO9iYjsDJrqJn7tavk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLY3Y4feKIhoOmVcseaSQRzGmRSsqtRWgzN7fB_gk9InQ&oe=6ABA7062"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Cifraria", "keywords": ["Viol\u00e3o", "Ukulele", "Cifras", "Letras", "Biblioteca"], "long_description": "O **Cifraria** \u00e9 uma biblioteca profissional de m\u00fasicas e de gerenciamento de cifras desenvolvido em Flutter.\nCriado para m\u00fasicos de todos os n\u00edveis, oferece uma experi\u00eancia fluida para gerenciar, transpor e praticar suas m\u00fasicas favoritas, tanto no celular quanto no Quest.\n\n\u2728 **Funcionalidades**\n\n\ud83d\udcc2 **Arquitetura Inteligente**: Organize suas m\u00fasicas em pastas personalizadas com uma barra lateral em glassmorphism (efeito de vidro) para um visual premium e moderno.\n\n\ud83d\udcdc **Gest\u00e3o de Repert\u00f3rios**: Crie listas personalizadas e organize as m\u00fasicas na ordem exata da sua apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o.\n\n\ud83d\udcf2 **Compartilhamento Pro**: Exporte seus repert\u00f3rios atrav\u00e9s da extens\u00e3o exclusiva .cifraria via apps de mensagem ou utilize o QR Code para que outro dispositivo com o app recrie a lista e as m\u00fasicas automaticamente.\n\n\ud83d\udd04 **Transposi\u00e7\u00e3o Instant\u00e2nea**: Mude o tom das m\u00fasicas em tempo real com um motor de transposi\u00e7\u00e3o robusto.\n\n\u2601\ufe0f **Sincroniza\u00e7\u00e3o em Nuvem (Google Drive)**: Fa\u00e7a backup e restaure com seguran\u00e7a toda a sua biblioteca, incluindo pastas e m\u00fasicas favoritas.\n\n\ud83d\udcf1 **Pronto para o Meta Quest**: Modo paisagem otimizado e dimensionamento de interface para um ambiente de pr\u00e1tica imersivo e sem distra\u00e7\u00f5es no Meta Quest.\n\n\ud83d\udcc4 **Importa\u00e7\u00e3o Multiformato**: Importe cifras da web (extra\u00e7\u00e3o com apenas um clique) ou de arquivos locais (PDF e DOCX).\n\n\ud83c\udfb6 **Cifras Interativas**: Acordes clic\u00e1veis com gera\u00e7\u00e3o autom\u00e1tica de diagramas, com suporte para Viol\u00e3o e Ukulele.\n\n\u26a1 **Foco em Performance**: Banco de dados local para carregamento instant\u00e2neo e funcionamento 100% offline.", "short_description": "O Cifraria \u00e9 uma biblioteca profissional de m\u00fasicas e o seu aplicativo definitivo para gerenciar cifras."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "icon_app_cifraria_1440.png", "id": "25137093062632621", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303140_25137093065965954_5340243871155545084_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pPTe955pT4EQ7kNvwHbnrts&_nc_oc=AdrcYAv-rN8R-bJxHpThaN5nBpJWjGgLNDzWeJVEkdI0mr2YLGqXL6a5e-v_OBvjJIw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI0QKMJ9ZJR4SUz11rqXoPFskCZrhV7pZpM7d687N0CVg&oe=6ABA76A4"}, {"file_name": "icon_app_cifraria_512.png", "id": "1950929249182186", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308090_1950929252515519_3579238828299289210_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=od1gYJ_8LgEQ7kNvwEv2ITh&_nc_oc=AdqJAabtGDJn5Lw6NYPq_0n9RzGrQFmHvDpZISUa35xOSULpHVXp-51-fpB-JYw59vI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJFSwK2x-_v2RDLmMeQvSWuoT1_d2Pac4Ekxe-WAr6K2g&oe=6ABA797C"}, {"file_name": "cover art cifraria.png", "id": "1221596580110880", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307422_1221596583444213_1996221161851683055_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YFr4OKGPL2wQ7kNvwG6kyzO&_nc_oc=AdrC0THg8VJpHN5TnUuiZcq1PlzBUNLzYtOccTA1KyLcRA1QKNcHcKVpA4gA7bjm5A8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQInp5nCjJyZuFH3DS5Bfnk1To5audS4CmPMjzrHmU2zDQ&oe=6ABA646E"}, {"file_name": "hero cover cifraria.png", "id": "955328883720100", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303140_955328887053433_2299564742518944745_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YOCRy_s_I-oQ7kNvwFYVAgH&_nc_oc=AdphNdFgHO6dAGHoubMtsr-RMcYVaHMO61KaFOHDmqj372LMCoXvMbG5HrUNnP81l6E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLRmuXuz_AdWd3wkLvOQtDs4oOXNKuwIWmand95vKXkcg&oe=6ABA5E09"}, {"file_name": "cover_cifraria_portrait.png", "id": "923398230271609", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303790_923398233604942_8149238291275724655_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BFNh3rk0hv8Q7kNvwHqoW6O&_nc_oc=Adq0jMggjJhAclQtMHWETcuJaALJ7DyuVxN3uZARQ7jGBtd3qi-CrXTkIX82oia9rg0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIyjXzGTwW15srdTuI5nd1X1Kox7NJZp0MOunJc1aUXeg&oe=6ABA6DD6"}]}, "id": "2120506675398089", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "home_10_Quest.png", "id": "1645036636740857", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819323_1645036640074190_2595786236772761378_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5Iy_XokSmDMQ7kNvwFHG_VX&_nc_oc=AdoOw-T-7BI4x4wFy1l_JBEaMHoaEjLA-KHY6Jriavi58Mei-7mUjGeRurWhgRZQUgA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKrtZvWOEnXN6xhZLE16OdQGUcp6MVJIPyDA4IVACwhdA&oe=6ABA5972"}, {"file_name": "settings_10_Quest.png", "id": "827413820421285", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820855_827413823754618_7016173846081243344_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gt_dO4I604UQ7kNvwGKvlv7&_nc_oc=AdoBJexHyMTkseeECjMNaH1bDgRDgXKN3bQjLcdxLfl3WcTH0Bhp1_dlUEK9Gk5Ofh8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIvfKpVxneP9ay69O0CKM6nzM2fAIqmm1efXbDNkx8fNQ&oe=6ABA8666"}, {"file_name": "home_10_settings_Quest.png", "id": "1684432329357395", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819854_1684432332690728_2661215708382739758_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hl0daeRXkyYQ7kNvwGEnUEA&_nc_oc=Adp6zF_WZLPHD_PN70HMvM6STNq03PE8gxJnyeiqwAJaBQC-x1Zwyh4yXU3VLiNIYqs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIZjpjN2MuFSbdXOdlKh4s-89dFdOxaY3jTufenN1AnVw&oe=6ABA8A23"}, {"file_name": "edit_10_Quest.png", "id": "991159246965883", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821682_991159253632549_3726168677936387175_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Kj-mwJNoxL0Q7kNvwGmwpV8&_nc_oc=AdoenoaI2S2J5Rf2iGh11SfKk4BKELfS7rZp-8eIQkyk6wNUO3xuXQiCqpKgs-nqMz8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIY3Wzz1J7cobGik3TFcYDTJn3vdCGb11HXgbm57g68BA&oe=6ABA7223"}, {"file_name": "player_10_Quest.png", "id": "966149539200528", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823296_966149542533861_6133643743596760205_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sxygMd2J1sUQ7kNvwGs_VMV&_nc_oc=AdrbM9toHVxJLgJBTeYKqC-clpeRbEdAJymgd-Z0YIXBf2XBzi7tpXK5w05KzTd4nDc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKEbvzV9vlx7n5gJrRBpmRbE7lGOeH4cpChvT0RFZgPZg&oe=6ABA7178"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Cifraria", "keywords": ["Guitar", "Chords", "Songbook", "Lyrics", "Ukulele"], "long_description": "**Cifraria** is a professional song library and guitar chord management application built with Flutter.\n\nDesigned for musicians of all levels, it offers a seamless experience for managing, transposing, and practicing your favorite songs across Mobile and Meta Quest devices.\n\n\u2728 **Features**\n\n\ud83d\udcc2 **Smart Library Architecture**: Organise your songs into custom folders with a glassmorphism sidebar for a premium feel.\n\n\ud83d\udcdc **Setlist Management**: Create custom lists and organize the songs in the exact order of your performance.\n\n\ud83d\udcf2 **Pro Sharing**: Export your setlists using the exclusive .cifraria extension via messaging apps or use the QR Code so that another device with the app can automatically recreate the list and songs.\n\n\ud83d\udd04 **Instant Transposition**: Change song keys on the fly with a robust transposition engine.\n\n\u2601\ufe0f **Cloud Sync (Google Drive)**: Securely backup and restore your entire library, including folders and favorite status.\n\n\ud83d\udcf1 **Meta Quest Ready**: Optimized landscape mode and UI scaling for a distraction-free practice environment in Meta Quest.\n\n\ud83d\udcc4 **Multi-format Import**:  Import songs from the web (one-click extraction) or local files (PDF & DOCX).\n\n\ud83c\udfb6 **Interactive Chord Charts**: Clickable chords with automatic diagram generation, supporting both Guitar and Ukulele.\n\n\u26a1 **Performance First**: Local database persistence for instant loading and 100% offline functionality.", "short_description": "Cifraria is a professional song library and guitar chord management application"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/18BVoWuGr5oKZaX6z0ZCklOlUod5mBmQH/view?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "David Kalil Braga", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://davidkalil10.github.io/Cifraria_Website/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "1063584910766706"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_g